Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:06.56,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,The letter that arrived for Marie \Nfrom Baron Shaderan and his wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:12.21,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,You good-for-nothing with your hideous red \Nhair, apologize to Anastasia and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.44,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Her mother writes nothing \Nbut horribly abusive words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.13,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,And her father...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:19.67,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie, why haven't you returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:23.97,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Your work is here in this \Nhouse! Come back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:27.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The opinions of husband \Nand wife appear to clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:32.58,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Would parents really tyrannize \Ntheir own child this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:37.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, while I'm gone, I'd like \Nyou to investigate something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:40.02,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:15.61,Narration Top,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,A month has passed since the knights' \Nfestival that struck like a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:16.36,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,320)\3c&H7E7F75&\fad(446,429)\c&HF5F6EB&}Episode 6 "Am I Enough As I Am?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:19.86,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The weather is so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:22.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Today seems like it will be a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.43,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,Good morning, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.41,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,Are you already awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Good morning. Yes, I'm already awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I win today, Wolfgang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.33,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,It appears that you've beaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:42.12,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.24,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,Come now, Cillie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:48.69,Default,Woflgang,0,0,0,,I do apologize. My granddaughter \Nis still just an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's all right. Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Good morning, Caecilie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:56.81,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Look! Tunika gave me buns!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:57.99,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Am I cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, very. I've never seen any girl \Nthey suited so well before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:04.34,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.51,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,I'll do your hair like this too, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:09.96,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Mio has other business again \Ntoday, so I'm your attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:14.26,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,By the way, my lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:18.46,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,what will you be wearing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:22.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Let's see. Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:26.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.27,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie, you're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.02,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,You are truly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:35.55,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,If the master were to see you, he'd \Nembrace you before even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,L-Lately, it's so strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:44.59,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,When I think of Lord Kyros, my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:49.51,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie, hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.57,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,My lady, where are you \Ngoing in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:55.51,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Lunch isn't for a while yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:58.70,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It isn't that, Toppo. You see, today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.90,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,The day the master comes home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:06.53,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Then, today you'll be eating your \Nparfait with the master, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:06.97,Default Top,Johan,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.93,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Take these with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.19,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Let's go, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.93,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Johan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:26.00,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Count Kyros Granado has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:43.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm back, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,W-Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What are those flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:52.52,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I think they're damask roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:55.85,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Johan told me to bring \Nthem. Do you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:05:01.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,They aren't for me. \NThey're an accessory for you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:05.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Though, in a way, they are \Na present for me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:08.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are like a flower personified.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I nearly embraced you \Nwithout even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.16,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie, your face is steaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:15.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please don't mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.40,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:21.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? Oh, the bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:21.92,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,P-Please, don't tease me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.22,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I am not teasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:39.68,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You have grown even more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:45.87,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I-I just know he's teasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:55.20,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I thought we'd have dinner together, \Nbut he's already gone out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:06:00.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The betrothal ceremony is coming \Ntogether nicely, but I'm still nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:04.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Aside from helping my father and \Nthe things I learned in school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:06.32,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's at times like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:16.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,"The Tale of the Raggedy Red Cat."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:19.93,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I often read this when I \Nfelt anxious, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:39.03,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,My lady, wouldn't it be better \Nto do this tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:43.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Once I've found out how to \Nbind this book, I'll go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.32,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:54.26,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I thought I heard footsteps, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:58.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-It has been quite some time, Lady Liu Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.69,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie! It has been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:03.51,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you looking \Nfor something so late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:07.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. My book has fallen to pieces, \Nand I'd like to mend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:10.58,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Well, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:20.24,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's like a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:22.21,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You must like books.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I do. Do you like them too, Lady Liu Liu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:30.26,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I'm here for research.\NMy spelling in Diltzian is still shaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is that... a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone you can \Nask to write it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:40.48,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Kyros is very busy, \Nso he's asked me to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:44.66,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,That is an invitation to attend \Nthe betrothal ceremony, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:49.66,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,It must be written by the couple in \Nquestion, or someone close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:53.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, would it be wrong for me to write them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:56.81,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What? You'd do that?\NThat would be such a help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:02.93,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,These are for people in \NIpsandros, so I'll write them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I can do the ones in Ipsian, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.79,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What? Miss Marie, you understand Ipsian?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:11.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, but only to read and write, \Nand for everyday conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:14.70,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,The lady loves Ipsandrian stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:17.02,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,She came here to mend this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.68,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Raggedy Red Cat{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.51,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Oh, how nostalgic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:26.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My older sister read it to me when I was \Nlittle. It's a book I love very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:31.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And my sister seems to have learned \NIpsian from our late grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:33.53,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What a well-learned grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:40.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My father says she was an eccentric \Nlayabout who studied foreign languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:42.47,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Women don't need academics!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:45.26,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,The reason my mother was \Nalone and without charm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:47.29,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,was all due to her dabbling in academics!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:49.42,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.30,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,A clever woman who knows other languages...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:57.27,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,She'd be quite the catch for merchants\N and the nobility, wouldn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:03.02,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Though, Ipsian isn't very practical unless \Nyou are engaged in trade with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.82,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Flarian and Shainan on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I speak those!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Though I studied them both on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:10.85,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:13.75,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie, you're the daughter \Nof a baron, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:17.15,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Many of the tenant farmers on \NShaderan lands are immigrants,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:21.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,so knowing foreign languages is \Nessential to properly manage things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:23.21,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,And you did all that, Miss Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:26.57,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Even though it's incredibly \Nimportant work for a baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.57,0:09:27.92,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:31.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, but my father put together \Nthe management plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:34.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I only really assisted in simple matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.69,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,"Assisted in simple matters," you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:42.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I love to write letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.56,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Even though I wrote \Non someone else's behalf,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,it allowed me to converse \Nwith someone as an equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:59.00,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,What beautiful handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.25,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You clearly put a lot\N of heart into that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:06.43,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Sign it with your own name, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.83,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.88,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You didn't write that on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:16.11,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You're the one who composed \Nthose lovely words, Miss Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:19.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,My own...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I did... didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.14,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.40,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,To be honest, I didn't expect much from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:46.53,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I heard that you were a noble daughter from \Nthe countryside who hadn't entered society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:51.18,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,But you were the first person \NKyros ever proposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.83,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,and a long time ago, a lot \Nof people helped me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:58.47,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I thought that I'd help you \Nwherever you might be lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.10,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:02.43,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,But I take it all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.81,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that you'll be my son's wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.47,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I've come to love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:12.57,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I am an imperfect mother,\Nbut I hope we'll get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:19.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It isn't what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:24.70,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's all right. \NCry as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:39.96,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,I wasn't sad at all, but for some \Nreason, my tears just wouldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:43.92,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,I cried like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:58.66,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.39,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Before you go and see Lady Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:03.27,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,may I have a moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:08.45,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've finished investigating the \Nmatter you inquired about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie really is the daughter \Nof the baron and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Everyone in the Shaderan \Nfamily is related by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:18.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you certain about these results?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:20.11,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:23.33,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The records of noble family trees kept \Nsafe in the Royal Palace Library
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:25.96,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,show no evidence of an adopted \Nchild or remarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Could the baron have \Nforced himself on a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Or his wife could have had an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.39,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,These records come from the royal \Ncapital's maternity hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:37.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Records of the births \Nof Marie and Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The younger brother was born at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:42.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but Lady Elvira definitely \Ngave birth to the sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,How did she seem at the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:47.43,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I was told that both parents \Nshed tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Could there have been \Na mix-up at the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:53.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's a small hospital with just one bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:56.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I believe the chances of \Nthat are incredibly slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:13:02.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Then the people who spew these cursed \Nwords at her are her actual parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:07.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, if it were human nature for parents \Nto love their children unconditionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and to protect them through anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.24,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,then I would not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.94,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I was told that this arrived this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,"Father on his deathbed. Return at once."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:24.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This is basically a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:29.68,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If she sees this, I believe that Lady \NMarie will return to her parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.03,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,What can I do to protect Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:40.54,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,And even if I can protect her, keeping her \Nlocked in this fortress like it's a birdcage...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:44.06,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Would that bring her happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:46.98,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie, drop your hips straight down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:51.37,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Do not forget to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:54.14,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Emotions are key to a curtsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:58.64,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,If you show them respect without expressing \Na feeling of welcome, then there's no point!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:13:59.22,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.73,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Is she being bullied by her \Nfuture mother-in-law?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.20,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Liu Liu, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:08.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Kyros! Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:15.03,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Kyros! You've arrived at the perfect \Ntime. Be her practice partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:16.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Practice partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:20.41,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,That's right. For when Miss Marie has \Nto meet royalty and other nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:23.97,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What? I told you that you don't have \Nto make her do any of this, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You and I can handle all of that \Nat the betrothal ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie has never been \Nintroduced into society!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:31.71,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,That's why she's practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:35.80,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Miss Marie is clever, \Nand she has an aptitude for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.92,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Her posture is quite nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I trained by chopping wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:42.65,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I see. That's why your figure is so stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:43.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, but it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:47.75,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,I wanted Marie to be able to \Ndress in beautiful things,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:51.43,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,332)}and to help her live a happy, \Npeaceful life, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:55.23,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:58.62,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie's curtsy is really stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:14:59.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:08.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for coming to \Ncelebrate the two of us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:13.54,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,And it isn't just the etiquette \Ninvolved in greetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:17.24,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Miss Marie wrote all the \Nthank you letters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why are you working her so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:21.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That makes us no different \Nfrom the Shaderan—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.17,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Son, remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.49,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Love and overprotectiveness \Nare not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.72,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Women are not baby birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:32.11,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Don't trap her in a cage. Make sure \Nshe has the chance to take flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:36.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, did I do it well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:40.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes. It was irreproachable. Truly lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:41.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You've worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:45.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.68,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,The first time I met her...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.97,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,she smiled that same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:52.34,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Now then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.79,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Shall we take a little break?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:56.53,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Let's all have tea together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.77,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Yay! Snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.77,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,I want to eat something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:04.79,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Indeed! I'm sure Toppo will have \Nsomething prepared for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:04.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Wait, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:05.93,Default Top,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:08.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There's something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:09.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This is from your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:17.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I worry about you \Nreturning alone. I'll go with—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:19.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There's no need for me to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:20.67,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.97,0:16:22.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Because this is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:25.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This is my father's handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A person supposedly on \Nhis deathbed wrote this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:32.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,By chance, have other \Ndemanding letters arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:33.55,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:36.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.76,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They must have had truly\Nsickening things written in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:42.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,and you protected me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry for acting \Nwithout your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Hiring people would cost money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:51.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sure he has work that he \Nwants to foist off on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It isn't that he wants to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:00.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My parents hate me, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The way they yelled at me all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.01,0:17:06.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,they weren't disciplining me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:10.87,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Before, no matter how \Nmuch Marie was bullied,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:14.53,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,she thought it was natural because she \Nthought she wasn't lovely, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.13,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You've grown so strong, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:25.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to the people here in \Nthe palace, and to you, Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.45,0:17:29.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you for treating me with such care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.94,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:40.20,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:43.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:56.50,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,My lady, your dress today \Nis lovely, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you. Cillie picked it out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.57,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Right? She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.72,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,The way this is going, I can also...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:06.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You look adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(645,1)\fs30\an8\shad0\b1\fnArial\c&H000000&\3c&H85760D&\move(370,29,332,29}SILENCE...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:14.06,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.81,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Does she hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:22.42,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm not accustomed to hearing \Nsuch things from gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:26.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I see. I'm sorry for making you nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.54,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,And now, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.76,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,A blueberry tart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.35,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:33.79,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:37.12,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Oh, my lady! That dress is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Really? Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:42.75,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Why? Toppo is a man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:45.44,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,She already treats everyone \Nelse as family, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:48.35,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Is it because I've been away so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:52.15,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, I will stay by your \Nside from now on, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:56.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You're back. Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:19:00.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes. I apologize for any trouble \Nmy absence may have caused you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.45,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, I'm terribly sorry to \Ninterrupt while you are relaxing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:05.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:08.72,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I would like to request a leave of absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:11.26,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,There is somewhere rather \Nremote that I would like to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:16.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh no! But you've only just returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.92,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But even I have someone \NI want to go and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:27.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, how lovely! I'm sorry for saying \Nanything that might keep you from going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:30.06,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Not at all. It made me happy to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.15,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, with the betrothal \Nceremony drawing near,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:35.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,please take some time\N to bond privately with the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:40.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, you're right. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:46.59,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What is all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:48.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's for Baron Shaderan and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:51.65,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I stressed that they are not allowed \Nto speak badly of my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:54.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,and I wrote out all of Marie's \Nlovely qualities in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:56.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What are you doing with yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:59.88,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If by chance you see the \Nbaron where you're going,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.21,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I thought you could clobber him with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.26,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:07.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And use the palace carriage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.63,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Also, take at least one attendant with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:13.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:15.45,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:18.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want someone with you so that you \Ndon't have to use that strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:21.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't take the villain's role, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:30.21,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Um, why am I here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:32.50,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Miss Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.45,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The master told me to bring someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:37.95,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,B-But isn't this a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:41.29,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,You're going to see your \Nsweetheart, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.04,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If I really were seeing a \Nsweetheart, then it would be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:46.43,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Then, is it a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.39,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Miss Mio, you have friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:50.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The legends of your homeland, Louhav Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:52.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,say that anyone who dies \Nbefore the age of eighteen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:54.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,can travel to paradise, without exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:55.77,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Congrats! Have a nice trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:57.78,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:01.23,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You're meant to ward off bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:05.50,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,There was a tragic accident \Nhere two months ago, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:08.28,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,An accident two months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:12.23,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Oh, are you traveling to the Shaderan lands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:14.90,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:20.75,Default Top,Tomas,0,0,0,,"Big sis, come home. Elder \Nsister is already home."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:20.74,Letter Font,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,1)\an8\pos(307,190)}Big sis, come home. \NElder sister is already home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:20.74,Letter Font,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,1)\an8\pos(311,283)}From Cedric
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.62,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,"From Cedric."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.43,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Who's Cedric?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:27.65,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie's younger brother \Nwho turns six this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:31.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A letter was included in \Nthe package we received earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:35.59,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,What? But Lady Marie's older \Nsister passed away, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:38.18,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Her carriage fell from a cliff\Nwith her inside, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.18,0:21:38.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.44,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,According to a more detailed investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.84,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,they were attacked by \Nbandits on the flatlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:47.53,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and as they fled along the river, the \Ncarriage overturned in the muddy waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:50.43,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Then, is it possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:55.92,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The river water was cold, and the rain from \Nthe previous day had caused it to swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:21:59.24,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Rescuing anyone who fell \Nin would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:00.59,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:03.83,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,But if that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:06.00,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,then what about this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:17.40,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Oh, your hair is as beautiful as silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:23.20,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,My lovely, lovely Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.81,0:24:00.05,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,This is Tomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:04.33,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Doing as Miss Mio said and setting \Nout on a journey is fine with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.33,0:24:06.87,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,but I never imagined things \Nwould turn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:12.38,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Miss Mio has me dancing to her tune. I feel \Nlike my life has gotten shorter because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:17.04,Default Top,Tomas,0,0,0,,Next time, "You're So Close, I \NThink You May Make Me Dizzy."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.60,0:24:27.01,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(438,1)\pos(487,321)}Episode 7 "You're So Close, I \NThink You May Make Me Dizzy"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:20.41,Default Top,Tomas,0,0,0,,I'm begging you. Please watch, won't you?
